## Spec Organization

Methodology: `docs/spec-strategy.md` (stage one) and `docs/verification-strategy.md`
(later stages).

```
docs/
├── spec-strategy.md
├── verification-strategy.md
├── spec/                         # Platform specs
│   ├── index.md                  # Start here
│   ├── stack.md
│   ├── hardware.md
│   ├── build-order.md
│   ├── parked.md                 # Topics set down to come back to
│   ├── system-description.md     # Sweep input
│   ├── claims.md                 # What the system claims, and what it does not
│   └── model.rs                  # Shared model types
├── {{subsystem}}/spec/
│   ├── index.md
│   ├── [feature].md              # Feature specs, with notes and numbered decisions
│   └── model.rs                  # The subsystem's model; home of its formal items
└── sweeps/<date>-<name>/         # Sweep archives. Read merged.md, never passes/.
model/                            # Crate that compiles every model.rs
tools/check                       # Reference checker
```

